580|App Version|应用程序版本|Approved|
581|Hardware Version|硬件版本|Approved|
582|Firmware|固件版本|Approved|
583|Dice|Dice|Approved|
584|FPGA|FPGA|Approved|
585|"Before we show you around, let's set your microphone level. Speak into your microphone in your normal speaking voice and set the gain so your volume remains in the \""Good\"" range."|在使用本产品前，需要先将麦克风音量设置到适当的位置。 用正常说话的声音对着麦克风说话，并调整增益推子，使音量保持在“良好”范围内。|Approved|
586|Now that your gain is set up, let's run through a little tutorial to get you acquainted with the App and Device.|现在您的增益已设置完毕，让我们通过一个小教程来让您熟悉应用程序和设备。|Approved|
587|The GoXLR app is divided into 3 panels: Browser, Device View, and Configuration.|GoXLR应用程序分为三个面板：浏览器面板、设备视图和配置。|Approved|
588|The Browser panel is where you can save and load profiles as well as view and load samples you've uploaded to the GoXLR app or have recorded in the past.|浏览器面板是您可以保存和加载配置文件以及查看和加载音频采样的地方，包含有已经上传到GoXLR应用程序或过去所保存的。|Approved|
589|The Device View panel is a live representation of your current settings on GoXLR. The Device View panel shows you where your knobs and sliders are set as well as what lighting effects you have assigned. If you want to change something, click on the button, knob, or slider in the Device View panel and the GoXLR app will take you to the proper settings in the Configuration Panel.|设备视图面板是你在GoXLR上当前设置的实时表示。设备视图面板显示你的旋钮和推子设置的位置，以及你指定的颜色效果。如果你想改变设置，点击设备视图面板中的按钮、旋钮或滑块，GoXLR应用程序将带你到配置面板中的适当设置。|Approved|
590|The Configuration panel is where you will make all of your adjustments to GoXLR. Here you can change how your microphone sounds, control your effects presets, and determine which inputs go to your headphones, chat program, and broadcast software.|配置面板是您对 GOXLR 进行所有调整的地方。您可以在此处调整麦克风的效果、调整效果预设，以及确定哪些声音输入进您的耳机、聊天软件和直播平台。|Approved|
591|That's the gist of it! Now go ahead, explore, and start making cool things!|这就是它的要点！现在继续，探索，并开始制作很酷的东西！|Approved|
