432|A DCP Error has occured. Please update your firmware to the most recent version. If firmware is up to date try repairing the driver with our driver repair wizard under Help and Support. If the problem is still not resolved reach out to our support team on discord.|发生 DCP 错误。请将固件更新到最新版本。如果固件是最新的，请尝试使用“帮助和支持”下的驱动程序修复向导修复驱动程序。如果问题仍未解决，请联系我们的支持团队。|Approved|
