191|The cough button behaves like a toggle i.e. you press it once to mute and a second time to unmute. Holding the cough button in this mode mutes to all sources.|静音按钮的行为类似于切换，即您按一次以静音，第二次按下它可以取消静音。在此模式下按住静音按钮可静音至所有信号源。|Approved|
