427|Error enumerating bus. If you continue to get this error try repairing your driver from the Help and Support window under the System tab in the application.|枚举总线时出错。如果您继续收到此错误，请尝试从应用程序中“系统”选项卡下的“帮助和支持”窗口修复驱动程序。|Approved|
428|Bus error: |总线错误：|Approved|
429|Error opening device. This can happen for a number of reasons. Check if an instance of the application, Beta or otherwise is already running in your task manager. If no other instances of the application are running try repairing your driver from the Help and Support window under the System tab in the application. If the problem persists seek assistance on our discord channel|打开设备时出错。发生这种情况的原因有很多。检查应用程序、Beta 或其他应用程序实例是否已在任务管理器中运行。如果没有应用程序的其他实例正在运行，请尝试从应用程序中“系统”选项卡下的“帮助和支持”窗口修复驱动程序。如果问题仍然存在，请在我们的Discord频道上寻求帮助|Approved|
