214|Time in milliseconds to fully CLOSE the gate|门限效果器从允许声音通过到静音所需时间（以毫秒为单位）|Approved|
215|Controls various frequencies to shape the sound of your voice|通过频率塑形来调整您的人声音色|Approved|
216|Controls several low frequencies simultaneously|非常低的声音区域，类似低频轰隆声|Approved|
217|Controls several mid frequencies simultaneously|同时控制多个中频频段|Approved|
218|Controls several high frequencies simultaneously|同时控制多个高频频段|Approved|
219|Very low voice range, rumble|非常低的人声区域，类似隆隆声|Approved|
220|Thickness and fullness|厚度和丰满度|Approved|
221|Honk or boxiness|喇叭声或拳击声|Approved|
222|Nasal sounds|鼻音|Approved|
223|"Presence or \""in your face\"""|临场感或“贴鼻感”|Approved|
224|"\""Air\"" and \""Siblance(ess sounds)\"""|“空气感”和“嘶嘶声（ess sounds）””|Approved|
225|Resets the frequency selection for each slider|重置所有推子音量和频点的调整|Approved|
226|Controls the loudest and softest mic sounds to give a more even sound|控制麦克风的声音大小动态来得到响度更均匀的声音|Approved|
227|Dynamically controls several compressor parameters|动态控制多个压缩器参数|Approved|
228|The level that the compressor begins acting on the signal|压缩器开始工作的信号电平值|Approved|
229|How much compression happens as you go over the threshold. Higher ratios compress more.|声音信号的压缩量。比率越高，压缩越多。|Approved|
230|How fast the compressor starts acting after the signal goes over the threshold|声音信号超过阈值后压缩器到达完全工作状态所需时间|Approved|
231|How long the compressor waits to stop compressing after the signal goes below the threshold|声音信号低于阈值后压缩器到达完全停止工作状态所需时间|Approved|
232|When a signal is compressed, it reduces its overall level. Makeup gain adds that level back into the signal.|信号被压缩时，信号会低于原始电平，增益补偿推子可以补偿被压缩后的信号电平|Approved|
233|"Reduces \""ess\"" sounds in the signal"|减少信号中的类似于“嘶嘶”样的唇齿音|Approved|
234|Advanced mute modes|增强的静音模式|Approved|
235|Choose how the mute button on this fader behaves|选择此推子上静音按钮的作用方式|Approved|
236|Default: Mutes the source audio on this fader to every output|默认：这个推子下的声音来源将被静音，不能发送到所有输出|Approved|
237|Press to mute source audio only to Broadcast Stream Mix USB output. Hold to mute to all sources.|短按只静音去直播推流混音的输出。长按静音去全部输出信号。|Approved|
238|Press to mute source audio only to Chat Mic USB output. Hold to mute to all sources.|短按只静音去语音软件的输出。长按静音去全部输出信号。|Approved|
239|Press to mute source audio only to Headphones. Hold to mute to all sources.|短按只静音去耳机监听的输出。长按静音去全部输出信号。|Approved|
240|Press to mute source audio only to Line Out. Hold to mute to all sources.|短按只静音去线路输出的输出。长按静音去全部输出信号。|Approved|
241|"The four physical \""sliders\"" that control audio levels"|GOXLR声卡的四个硬件推子用来控制所选信号源的声音大小|Approved|
242|Choose which USB device sends audio to that fader|选择哪一个USB设备虚拟通道音频发送到那个推子|Approved|
243|The faders, counted from left to right|推子顺序，从左到右数|Approved|
244|Controls the level of your microphone. This is NOT the mic gain that is set in Mic Setup. This usually stays at 100%.|控制麦克风的电平。这不是在麦克风设置中设置的麦克风增益。这里通常建议保持在100%。|Approved|
245|Controls the level of Voice Chat USB device. Discord, Skype, etc.|控制语音聊天软件平台虚拟输出音频通道的音量，YY、TT等等|Approved|
246|Controls the level of Music USB device. Spotify, etc.|控制音乐APP虚拟输出音频通道的音量。如网易云.酷狗等|Approved|
247|Controls the level of Game USB device|控制游戏软件USB音频输出通道的音量。如:绝地求生.DOTA等|Approved|
248|Controls the level of the Optical input|控制光纤输入的音量|Approved|
249|Controls the level of the Line input|控制线路输入的音量|Approved|
250|Controls the Level of the Line output|控制线路输出的音量|Approved|
251|Controls the level of the System USB device|控制电脑系统USB输出通道的音量|Approved|
252|Controls the sample playback level|控制采样器的回放音量|Approved|
253|Controls the level of the bleep sound|控制哔声的音量|Approved|
254|Controls the level of your headphones|控制耳机的音量|Approved|
255|Controls the level of your mic in your headphones as a percentage of the overall Mic volume|控制耳机中麦克风音量占麦克风总音量的比例|Approved|
256|Control the level of various inputs and outputs|控住各路输入输出通道的音量|Approved|
257|These are the actively saved presets on your profile. Right click on the name of the preset to rename or save. Drag to reorder.|这些是配置文件中默认保存的预设。右键单击预设的名称可以重命名或保存。拖动可以重新排序。|Approved|
258|"Reverb changes the \""room\"" effect of your voice."|混响会改变人声在空间内的效果|Approved|
259|"Reverb style indicates the type of \""room\"" you're trying to emulate. The bigger the room, the longer the tail."|不同混响风格可以模拟出不同的空间效果，空间越大，混响时间越长|Approved|
260|"The greater the amount of reverb, the less of your \""dry\"" mic signal you will hear."|混响量越大，麦克的干声信号听起来会越少|Approved|
261|Echo recreates a series of sounds created by your mic and sends it back to the listener - like yelling in a cave.|“回声”将会重放麦克风的声音，就像在山洞中大喊一样|Approved|
262|Echo Style refers to the different types of echoes that you can choose from.|回声类型值得是您可以选择不同风格的回声效果|Approved|
263|The Echo Amount refers to how long your voice will echo. Tap the physical active preset button on the GoXLR face to set the tempo.|“回声”的数量指的是您的的声音会有多长时间的回音。点击GOXLR软件面板的速度（Tempo）按钮来设置速度|Approved|
264|Raises or lowers the pitch of your voice|提高或降低声音的音调|Approved|
265|"\""Narrow\"" allows you go up or down 12 semi-tones (1 octave), while \""Wide\"" allows you pitch up or down 24 semi-tones (2 octaves)."|“窄的”可以有12个半音的调整区间（一个八度），“wide”有24个半音的调整区间（两个八度）|Approved|
266|The Pitch Amount determines how many semi-tones higher or lower you want your voice to sound.|变调的数量决定了您想让声音听起来高或低多少半音|Approved|
267|When the loudness of your voice passes the determined threshold is when pitch shifting occurs. Keep this at -36dB by default. If you notice background noises getting pitch-shifted, raise the threshold.|当您的声音响度超过设定的阈值时，将发生音高偏移时。默认数值是-36dB。如果您注意到背景噪音也发生音高偏移的话，请提高阈值数值。|Approved|
268|Adjusts the type of pitch shifting between a more character style shift and musical one. Lower values will be more true to your original voice but introduce more artifacts while higher values will sound more obviously different.|在更具个性的风格转换和音乐风格之间调整音高转换的类型。但引入更多的人为因素，而较高的值将听起来更明显不同 |Approved|
269|"Gender allows you to change the formant and timbre of your voice beyond pitch shifting. While \""Pitch\"" is up and down, \""Gender\"" is narrow and wide."|性别调整是在音高转换之外更改声音的共振峰和音色。“音高调节”是上下变调，“性别”调整共振峰。|Approved|
270|"The wider the Gender Style, the more extreme the effect. For smaller timbre changes, use \""Narrow.\"" For large ones, use \""Wide.\"""|性别风格越宽，效果越极端。对于较小的音色变化，请使用 \“窄”。\“对于较大的更改，请使用 \”宽“。\”|Approved|
271|The Amount refers to how drastic the formant shift is. Smaller amounts are less drastic than larger amounts.|数量是指共振峰位移的剧烈程度。数值越大效果越明显|Approved|
272|Megaphone will change your voice to make you sound like you're coming out of a AM speaker, walkie talkie, or similar.|扩音器会改变你的声音，让你听起来像是从收音机、对讲机或类似设备出来的。|Approved|
273|You can change the megaphone presets to best suit the situation and your voice.|您可以更改扩音器预设调整到最适合您的声音。|Approved|
274|The Robot effect ... makes your voice sound ... like a robot.|机器人效果...让你的声音听起来...像机器人一样。|Approved|
275|"We created 3 \""default\"" robot voices for you."|"我们提前预置了3个“机器人""音效预设"|Approved|
276|Hardtune will pitch correct your voice to the determined source so that even YOU can sing in key!|音高修正(Hardtune)可以在唱歌时实时的将人声修正到正确的调内|Approved|
277|"Hardtune comes with 3 different styles. Natural is a subtle pitch correction, while Hard will force your voice to the \""correct\"" note."|音高修正(Hardtune)具有3种不同的风格。自然是一种微妙的音高校正，而Hard会迫使你的声音达到“正确”的音符，类似于电音。|Approved|
278|If you have multiple sources playing sounds and music, it can confuse the key. Choose a specific source for the most accurate hardtuning.|如果有多个源同时在播放声音和音乐，可能会使效果混淆。指定特定的源可以实现最准确的音高调整。|Approved|
279|"Determines how \""slammin\"" or robotic the hardtune effect is"|确定音高修正(Hardtune)的“slammin”或机器人效果|Approved|
280|"How quickly does the hardtune move you to the \""correct\"" note"|以多快的速度将音高修正到“正确”的调内|Approved|
281|How far from the correct note does hardtune begin moving you closer. A smaller window will sound more natural.|与正确的音符的相距多远时开始将您的声音修正到正确音符。较小的窗口值听起来会更自然。|Approved|
282|Choose from three banks of four samples each, giving you 12 total options.|从三组（每组四个样本）中进行选择，最大可存储12 条采样供选择。|Approved|
283|Shows which physical button you're currently working on|显示您当前正在使用的物理按钮|Approved|
284|Choose how playback for the sample occurs|选择音频采样文件的回放方式|Approved|
285|"Press to begin playback, press again to start sample over. In a \""stack\"", pressing starts next sample."|按开始播放，再按则重新回放采样文件。 *在有多个采样时，再按播放下一个采样|Approved|
286|Press to begin playback, press again to stop playback and reset to beginning of sample.|按下开始播放，再次按下播放停止，同时播放进度条回到采样文件的起始位置。|Approved|
287|Press to begin playback, press again to fade volume level slowly to zero.|按下后开始播放，重新按下逐渐淡出|Approved|
288|Hold button to play, release button to stop|按下按钮播放，松开按钮时停止播放|Approved|
289|Hold button to play, release button to begin fade out|按下按钮播放，松开按钮时逐渐淡出|Approved|
290|"Choose what order you want your \""stack\"" of samples to play in"|选择您希望列表内采样以什么顺序播放|Approved|
291|Press to begin looped (repeated) playback, press again to stop|按下开始循环(重复)播放，再次按下以停止播放|Approved|
292|List of sample or samples currently assigned to the selected bank/button|音频采样列表或当前已经分配到组/按钮的采样文件|Approved|
293|"Plays \""stack\"" of samples in sequential order"|按顺序播放采样|Approved|
294|"Plays \""stack\"" of samples in random order"|随机播放采样|Approved|
295|Click to add sample(s) from your library or drag and drop here. You may add more than one!|单击以从库中添加采样音频或拖放到此处。您可以添加多个！|Approved|
296|Waveform display of your sample audio|显示采样音频的波形|Approved|
297|Plays the loaded sample|播放所加载的音频采样文件|Approved|
298|Slide to adjust the start point of the sample playback|左右滑动以调整采样文件播放的起点|Approved|
299|Slide to adjust the end point of the sample playback|左右滑动以调整采样文件播放的终点|Approved|
300|Remove currently selected sample from button or stack|从按钮或采样列表中删除当前选定的采样|Approved|
301|Slide to adjust start and end points of sample playback|滑动以调整采样文件播放的起点和终点|Approved|
302|"Audio signals coming IN, either from physical jacks like \""Line In\"" or USB audio devices like \""System\"" or \""Game\""."|输入的音频信号，包含GOXLR后面板的物理插孔（如“线路输入”）或 USB 音频通道（如“系统”或“游戏”）的输出信号。|Approved|
303|"Audio signals going OUT, either from physical jacks like \""Headphones\"" or USB audio devices like \""Broadcast Stream Mix\"". These are \""mixes\"" of all things selected with check marks in the table and follow the levels set from the MIXER tab or via the faders."|来自物理插孔（如“耳机”）或 USB 音频设备（如“直播推流混音”）的音频信号。这些是在“调音台”选项卡中控制的内容，音量大小受“调音台”中推子设置的大小控制。|Approved|
304|"Your \""wet\"" or \""effected\"" mic signal, including any EQ or Voice FX."|您的“湿声”或“经过调整的”话筒信号，包含有任何的EQ均衡调整或人声效果器|Approved|
305|Audio coming via the Chat USB audio device FROM any chat programs or in-game chat. This is the sound of your friends on Discord coming to you, not what you send to them.|通过“CHAT” 虚拟USB音频输出传入的音频信号，指来自任何聊天软件内的声音。这是聊天软件内如TT、YY其他朋友的声音，而不是你发送给他们的声音。|Approved|
306|Programs or apps assigned to the Music USB audio device|分配给“MUSIC”虚拟音频通道的APP，如网易云、酷狗可指定到这路输出|Approved|
307|Programs or apps assigned to the Game USB audio device|"分配给""GAME""USB 虚拟音频通道的程序，如DOTA、绝地求生等游戏可指定到这路输出"|Approved|
308|Anything connected to the Console (SPDIF Optical) input|任何连接到GOXLR后面板的光纤输入(Console)，（SPDIF 光纤）接口的声音|Approved|
309|Anything connected to the Line In 3.5mm input. This is where your streaming PC comes into GoXLR on a 2PC setup.|任何连接到3.5mm线路输入。此接口可以将另外一台游戏电脑的声音信号连接到当前直播推流的电脑|Approved|
310|"Programs or apps assigned to the System USB audio device. That device should typically be set as your \""Default\"" audio device in Windows."|"""System""是分配给电脑系统的虚拟音频通道。该设备通常应设置为 Windows 中的“默认”音频播放设备。"|Approved|
311|This is where your samples will PLAY when you press a sample button. For example, if Chat Mic is selected people you speak with on Discord will hear your samples when you trigger them.|决定当播放采样音频文件时，哪个音频通道可以听到您的采样音频文件。如果选择了语音软件“Chat Mic”，则您在TT、YY上与之交谈的人将会听到这段采样音频。|Approved|
312|This is what you hear in your headphones|这是您在耳机中听到的声音|Approved|
313|"The Broadcast Stream Mix USB audio device is typically selected in OBS/XSplit etc. As your ONLY audio source for your stream. What you select here is \""what your stream audience hears\""."|虚拟音频通道通常为斗鱼/B站/OBS等直播软件的输入，作为唯一的直播推流音频源，该通道的信号将是“您的直播间观众所听到的声音”|Approved|
314|This is what comes from the 3.5mm Line Out jack and is typically used to send audio to speakers or your streaming PC in a 2 PC setup. In a 2PC setup, it's equivalent to the Broadcast Stream Mix. The Line In on your streaming PC should be the only input selected in OBS/XSplit etc.|Line Out是3.5mm线路输出插孔，可以将音频信号发送到扬声器或另一台流媒体直播电脑。|Approved|
315|"This is the audio that goes TO your friends on Discord etc. For example, if you check \""Music\"" they will hear any music you have playing via the Music USB audio device."|"CHAT MIC""""是发送到语音软件的虚拟音频通道，例如TT、YY。例如：您选中音乐输出“MUSIC”，他们将听到您通过音乐输出""MUSIC""虚拟音频通道播放的任何音乐。"|Approved|
316|"This is what goes TO the sampler when you record a new sample. For example, if you check \""Game\"" the sampler will capture audio from the Game USB audio device when recording. You may choose more than one."|这是当您要录制新的采样文件时，哪路信号可以发送给采样器。例如，如果选中游戏输出“GAME”，采样器将在录制时从游戏输出USB音频设备捕获音频。您可以同时选择多个|Approved|
317|"GoXLR Mini, while not having a sampler, still builds a \""sampler\"" audio device. Rather than hide it, we decided to allow you to route audio through it as a bonus channel."|GoXLR Mini虽然没有采样器，但我们依然保留了采样器“sapmle”虚拟USB采样音频通道。我们没有隐藏它，而是决定将它作为一个额外通道来路由音频信号。|Approved|
318|Selects the physical channel you're adjusting on the mixer, as shown by the image to the right of the channel name.|选择混音器上要调整的物理通道，如通道名称右侧的图像所示。|Approved|
319|An preview of how the image/text on the screen will look. It's an approximation, so it's best to look at the actual screen to confirm the final look.|预览屏幕上的图像/文本的外观。因为不同电脑屏幕会有色差，因此最好实时查看GOXLR的屏幕以确认最终外观。|Approved|
320|"Swaps light and dark areas of the screen, so that the images become colored and the background is \""black\"" (as dark as it can go with a light behind it)."|切换屏幕的明暗区域，使图像着色，背景是“黑色”(在后面有光的情况下尽可能暗)。|Approved|
321|Shows the Channel number (1-4) in the corner of the screen.|在屏幕左上角显示通道号|Approved|
322|Selects the color of the LED lighting for the screen.|选择LED屏中要显示的颜色|Approved|
323|Displays an image on the screen. Click the icon image to open the selection, import and crop tool.|在屏幕上显示的图像。单击icon的图片可以打开选择、导入和裁剪工具。|Approved|
324|Changes how higher resolution or color images show up on the screen. Play with the slider, then look at the screen to see how it adjusts clarity and definition in the icon image.|更改屏幕上图标或彩色图像的显示方式。左右拉动滑块，然后查看屏幕来调整图标图像中的清晰度和清晰度。|Approved|
325|Choose the text that appears on the screen.|选择屏幕上显示的文本。|Approved|
326|Click to add a new option to your text menu selections. This list appears across all profiles. Right click to rename or delete text items.|单击此项可添加新的文本到文本菜单列表中。此列表显示在所有配置文件均可以右键单击以重命名或删除文本项。|Approved|
327|Choose the size of your text. This will dynamically adjust the size of icons if they are active on the channel.|选择文本的大小尺寸。如果图标在通道上处于活动状态，这将动态调整图标的大小。|Approved|
328|After making selections for one fader, you can click this box to apply the look to all four faders. If you make further changes, you'll need to click again to re-apply to the remaining faders.|设置完一个推子后，可以单击此框将外观应用于所有四个推子。如果后续再次更改，则需要再次单击以重新应用于其他推子。|Approved|
329|"Allows you to change the basic \""show the level\"" operation of the fader to a Gradient or Meter mode style, or both."|允许您将基础的电平显示样式更改为“渐变”或“实时电平式”|Approved|
330|Creates a gradient between the chosen Bottom and Top colors selected.|在选定的“底部”和“顶部”颜色之间创建渐变。|Approved|
331|"Shows incoming audio levels from the assigned source, like Music or Line In etc. This setting will \""take over\"" the entire range of the fader to show level. Your fader still adjusts the volume of what you hear, but the meter won't follow it anymore."|显示来自指定源的输入音频电平，如“音乐输出”或“线路输入”等。此设置将“接管”推子的整个范围以显示电平。您的推子仍可调整您听到的声音的音量，但仪表LED灯将不再跟随推子。|Approved|
332|Sets the color of the LED's below the fader. As you slide the fader up, it will fill the space below the fader with this color.|设置推子下方LED灯珠的颜色，当你滑动推子时，它会填充对应颜色到下面的空间。|Approved|
333|Sets the color of the LED's above the fader. As you slide the fader down, it will fill the space above the fader with this color.|将LED的颜色设置在推子的上方。当你向下滑动推子时，它会用这个颜色填充推子上方的空间。|Approved|
334|"Sets the \""main\"" color of your mute button. This is the color shown when the channel is actively muted."|设置静音按钮的“主”颜色。这是通道主动静音时显示的颜色。|Approved|
335|"Sets the \""secondary\"" color of your mute button. This is the color shown when the channel is not muted. "|设置静音按钮的“辅助”颜色。这是通道未静音时显示的颜色。|Approved|
336|Controls what happens when the mute button is inactive (no muting).|控制静音按钮未激活时灯光颜色显示状态|Approved|
337|Uses a dim version of the active color when the mute is inactive.|当未激活静音时，使用激活时颜色的暗淡版本。|Approved|
338|Uses a full-brightness version of the selected inactive color when the mute is inactive.|当未激活静音时，使用所选颜色2的全亮度版本|Approved|
339|Uses a dimmed version of the selected inactive color when the mute is inactive.|当未激活静音时，使用所选颜色的暗淡版本。|Approved|
340|After making selections for one fader mute button, you can click this box to apply the look to all four mutes. If you make further changes, you'll need to click again to re-apply to the remaining mutes.|为一个推子静音按钮进行选择后，可以单击此框将外观应用于所有四个静音按钮。如果您进行了进一步的更改，则需要再次单击以重新应用于其他的静音按钮。|Approved|
341|Choose the physical voice fx preset button (1-6) that you want to change lighting for.|为GOXLR的(1-6）FX效果预设按钮调整灯光颜色。|Approved|
342|"Sets the \""main\"" color of your voice fx preset button. This is the color shown when the preset is active."|设置6个FX预设按钮的“主”颜色。这是预设效果按钮处于激活状态时显示的颜色|Approved|
343|"Sets the \""secondary\"" color of your voice fx preset button. This is the color shown when the preset is inactive."|设置6个FX预设按钮的“辅助”颜色。这是预设效果处于非激活状态时显示的颜色。|Approved|
344|After making selections for one preset button, you can click this box to apply the look to all six presets. If you make further changes, you'll need to click again to re-apply to the remaining presets.|为一个预设按钮进行选择后，可以单击此框将外观应用于所有六个预设。如果进行进一步的更改，则需要再次单击以重新应用于其余预设。|Approved|
345|Controls what happens to the button when the preset is inactive.|控制预设处于非活动状态时对按钮的处理方式。|Approved|
346|Uses a dim version of the selected active color when the voice fx preset is inactive.|当FX预设按钮处于未激活状态时，使用所选激活时颜色的暗淡版本。|Approved|
347|Uses a full-brightness version of the selected inactive when the voice fx preset is inactive.|当FX预设按钮处于未激活状态时，使用所选未激活状态的全亮度版本。|Approved|
348|Uses a dimmed version of the selected inactive when the voice fx preset is inactive.|当FX预设按钮处于未激活状态时，使用所选未激活状态的黯淡版本。|Approved|
349|Choose the physical knob that you want to change the lighting for.|选择要更改灯光颜色的物理旋钮。|Approved|
350|"Select the color to the left of the white position indicator on the knob. For Reverb and Echo, this \""fills up\"" as you increase level (turn clockwise). For Pitch and Gender, this \""fills down to the left\"" as you lower the pitch or gender (turn counter clockwise from the middle)."|选择旋钮上白色位置指示器左侧的颜色。对于混响和回声(ECHO)，当您增加电平（顺时针转动）时，此“填满”。对于音高和性别，当您降低音高或性别时，此“向左填充”（从中间逆时针转动）。|Approved|
351|"Select the color to the right of the white position indicator on the knob. For Reverb and Echo, this reduces as you increase level (turn clockwise). For Pitch and Gender, this \""fills up to the right\"" as you raise the pitch or gender (turn clockwise from the middle)."|选择旋钮上白色位置指示器右侧的颜色。对于混响和回声(ECHO)，随着电平的升高（顺时针转动），此值会降低。对于音高和性别，当您提高音高或性别时，此“向右填充”（从中间顺时针转动）。|Approved|
352|The color of the LED under the knob.|编码器中间LED灯珠的颜色。|Approved|
353|After making selections for one encoder, you can click this box to apply the look to all four encoders. If you make further changes, you'll need to click again to re-apply to the remaining encoder.|为一个编码器进行设置后，可以单击此框以将外观应用于所有四个编码器。如果进行进一步的更改，则需要再次单击以重新应用于其余编码器。|Approved|
354|Select the physical effect button you'd like to change the lighting for.|选择要更改其灯光颜色的物理效果按钮。|Approved|
355|"Sets the \""main\"" color of your voice fx button. This is the color shown when the effect is active."|设置语音 fx 按钮的“主”颜色。这是效果处于激活状态时显示的颜色。|Approved|
356|"Sets the \""secondary\"" color of the voice effects button. This is the color shown when the effect is inactive."|设置FX效果预设按钮的“主”颜色。这是效果处于激活状态时显示的颜色。|Approved|
357|Controls what happens to the button when the voice effect is inactive.|控制当FX效果预设处于未激活状态时对按钮执行的操作|Approved|
358|Uses a dim version of the selected active color when the voice effect is inactive.|当FX效果预设处于未激活状态时，使用所选激活时颜色的暗淡版本。|Approved|
359|Uses a full-brightness version of the selected inactive color when the voice effect is inactive.|当FX效果预设处于未激活状态时，使用所选未激活时颜色的全亮度版本。|Approved|
360|Uses a dimmed version of the selected active color when the voice effect is inactive.|当FX效果预设处于未激活状态时，使用所选激活时颜色的黯淡版本。|Approved|
361|After making selections for one voice effect button, you can click this box to apply the look to all four voice effect buttons. If you make further changes, you'll need to click again to re-apply to the remaining voice effect buttons.|为一个语音效果按钮进行设置后，可以单击此框以将外观应用于所有四个语音效果按钮。如果您进行了进一步的更改，则需要再次单击以重新应用于其余的语音效果按钮。|Approved|
362|Selects the sample bank you'd like to change lighting for.|选择要为其更改颜色的音频采样组。|Approved|
363|Sets the button color for the bank when it's selected and the sample pad color when it's loaded, recorded or playing.|设置选择库时的按钮颜色，以及加载、录制或播放时的采样播放按钮颜色。|Approved|
364|Sets the button color for this bank when it's not selected.|设置此采样组按钮在未选中时的按钮颜色。|Approved|
365|Sets a dim color of Active/Loaded for this bank button when it's not selected.|如果未选择此组按钮，则设置此组按钮使用“活动/已加载”颜色版本的黯淡版。|Approved|
366|Sets a bright color for this bank when it's not selected|在未选中此组时为其设置明亮的颜色|Approved|
367|Sets a dim color for this bank button when it's not selected.|在未选中此采样组按钮时为其设置暗淡的颜色。|Approved|
368|"Sets the \""secondary\"" color of this banks' button. This is the color shown when this bank is not selected."|设置此组按钮的“辅助”颜色。这是未选择此组时显示的颜色。|Approved|
369|Choose a color (or none) to show when a sample button is empty and ready to record.|选择一种颜色（或无颜色）以在采样按钮为空并准备录制时显示。|Approved|
370|Applies the currently selected color settings to all sample banks and buttons|将当前选定的颜色设置应用于所有音频采样组和按钮|Approved|
371|Lighting settings that do not relate to any particular section but the device as a whole|与任何特定部分无关的照明设置，而与整个设备相关|Approved|
372|Sets the color of the !@#$?* button|设置 ！@#$？* 按钮的颜色|Approved|
373|"Sets the color of the large \""cough\"" mic mute button"|设置GOXLR右下角最大的麦克风静音按钮的颜色|Approved|
374|"Controls the color of the \""X\"" in the GoXLR logo and the \""cheek lights\"" that come from inside the device."|控制 GoXLR 徽标中的“X”颜色和来自设备内部的“脸颊灯”的颜色。|Approved|
375|"Allows you to set the color of all lighting in the product at once. This can be a good jumping off point when creating a new profile. Note that changing your global lighting will also change the off option to \""Dim Active Color\"" for all buttons."|允许您一次设置产品中所有照明的颜色。在创建新配置文件时，这可能是一个很好的起点。请注意，更改全局照明也会将所有按钮的关闭选项更改为“使活动颜色变暗”。|Approved|
376|Left click on a component to navigate to the settings for that component.|左键单击组件以导航到该组件的设置。 |Approved|
377|Right click on a component to navigate to the lighting options for that component.|右键单击组件以导航到该组件的灯光颜色选项。|Approved|
378|"Sets the \""main\"" color of the cough/bleep buttons. This is the color shown when the buttons are active."|右键单击组件以导航到该组件的灯光颜色设置选项。|Approved|
379|Controls what happens to the cough/bleep buttons when they are inactive.|控制静音/哔哔声按钮处于未激活状态时发生的情况。|Approved|
380|Uses a dim version of the selected active color when the button is inactive.|当按钮处于未激活状态时，使用所选激活颜色的暗淡版本。|Approved|
381|Uses a full-brightness version of the selected inactive color when the button is inactive.|当按钮处于未激活状态时，使用所选未激活颜色的全亮度版本。|Approved|
382|Uses a dimmed version of the selected inactive when the button is inactive.|当按钮处于未激活状态时，使用所选未激活状态的黯淡版本。|Approved|
383|"Sets the \""secondary\"" color of the cough/bleep buttons. This is the color shown when the buttons are inactive."|设置静音/哔哔声按钮的“辅助”颜色。这是按钮处于非活动状态时显示的颜色。|Approved|
384|Select the button you want to change the color for.|选择要更改其颜色的按钮。|Approved|
385|Hex value and colour of what's currently selected|当前所选内容的十六进制值和颜色|Approved|
